1
00:00:00,646 --> 00:00:05,546
- So you've just been lying to him?
- You see the stuff in my nose? Rubber cement.

2
00:00:07,753 --> 00:00:11,883
(Bernadette:)I don't mean to be judgy,
but this is the kind of thing lunatics do.

3
00:00:13,526 --> 00:00:16,326
(Amy:)All right. I'll tell him.

4
00:00:16,529 --> 00:00:21,259
(Sheldon(off):)Amy, would you be strong enough
to bathe yourself or do you need my help?

5
00:00:25,371 --> 00:00:26,531
(Amy:)I'll tell him tomorrow.

6
00:00:28,841 --> 00:00:30,641
Momma needs a bath.

7
00:00:33,512 --> 00:00:36,672
(Penny:)Now, let's assume by some miracle
you actually catch a fish.

8
00:00:36,882 --> 00:00:40,042
You're gonna have to know how to gut it.
So, what you're gonna do...

9
00:00:40,553 --> 00:00:44,453
...is you're gonna take your knife,
slice him right up the belly.

10
00:00:48,761 --> 00:00:51,091
- Do you want me to stop?
- No, I'm fine. Keep going.

11
00:00:51,297 --> 00:00:59,027
You don't wanna cut too deep into his guts
or the blood will just squirt all over your face.

